{"strongs": "H8095", "word": "שִׁמְעוֺן", "translit": "shim.on", "root": "שמן", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "offspring of hyena and wolf", "definition": "שִׁמְעוֺן 44 proper name, masculine (compare proper name שמעון in Palmyrene Lzb 378 ; meaning doubtful; Rs and others compare said to mean offspring of hyena and wolf ; see Hogg EBiv. 4531 ); — 1. second son of Jacob and Leath, Συμεωη : Gen 29:33 (name explanation from שָׁמַע ), Gen 35:23 ; Exod 1:2 + 14 t. (associated especially with Levi Gen 34:25 ; Gen 34:30 ; Gen 49:5 ). 2. tribal name Judg 1:3 (twice in verse); Judg 1:17 ; Num 1:6 +; so ׳ גְּנֵי שׁ Num 1:22 + 7 t., ׳ מַטֵה שׁ Num 1:23 ; Num 2:12 ; Num 13:5 ׳ מַטֵּה גְנֵי שׁ Num 10:19 ; Num 34:20 ; Josh 19:1 ; Josh 19:8 ; Josh 21:9 ; 1Chr 6:50 . 3. post-exilic Jew with foreign wife Ezra 10:31 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8833')\">BDB8833</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8095')\">H8095</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8832')\">BDB8832</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8834')\">BDB8834</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שִׁמְעוֺן</bdbheb><sub>44</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (compare proper name <bdbheb>שמעון</bdbheb> in Palmyrene <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>378</sup></lookup>; meaning doubtful; Rs and others compare <placeholder5619/> said to mean <highlight>offspring of hyena and wolf</highlight>; see Hogg<sup>EBiv. 4531</sup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> second son of Jacob and Leath, <grk>Συμεωη</grk>: <ref ref=\"Gen 29:33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,33)\">Gen 29:33</ref> (name explanation from <bdbheb>שָׁמַע</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Gen 35:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,23)\">Gen 35:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 1:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,2)\">Exod 1:2</ref> + 14 t. (associated especially with Levi <ref ref=\"Gen 34:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,25)\">Gen 34:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 34:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,30)\">Gen 34:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 49:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,5)\">Gen 49:5</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> tribal name <ref ref=\"Judg 1:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,3)\">Judg 1:3</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Judg 1:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,17)\">Judg 1:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,6)\">Num 1:6</ref> +; so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גְּנֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,22)\">Num 1:22</ref> + 7 t., <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַטֵה שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,23)\">Num 1:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,12)\">Num 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 13:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,5)\">Num 13:5</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַטֵּה גְנֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,19)\">Num 10:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 34:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,20)\">Num 34:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,1)\">Josh 19:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,8)\">Josh 19:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 21:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21